From 996a5b860b2cd308e2de2a9fb9f780da25f5b56f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:21:25 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: title and tab bar colours; share sheet hands storage
 files LocalSend can read

- Top bar and tab row on one surface: the app bar paints the screen surface and does not lift
  (it showed surfaceContainer behind the tabs); the section divider under the bar is gone
- Top-bar icons in onSurface (Up/Close arrow was untinted black, search and overflow grey);
  the tab strip sits on a Surface, so New tab's + is no longer black
- Share sheet: storage documents go out as PlaitShareProvider stand-ins too (other providers
  and virtual files unchanged), so Share > LocalSend works like the LocalSend button

Checked on the phone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
